docs {
  # Petstore — Bruno collection

  The same private Petstore (Docker, port 8090) the Playwright suite uses. The collection is plain text
  (`.bru` files), lives in git next to the code and runs headless in CI with `bru run`.

  Requests in "01 Pet lifecycle" depend on each other through runtime variables (`petId`), so run the
  folder in order. "02 Validation" and "03 Store" are independent.
}
